d":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-04-15T18:32:34Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T01:54:59Z","closed_at":"2026-04-16T14:56:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.7.dev1.official [bf95b6258]\n- Reproducible in v4.7.dev4.official [755fa449c]\n- Reproducible in `master` [4fe68a9ed4a27047e8b5eab15765430c9cef4610]\n\nNOT reproducible with PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev1 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 61.64 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs some may know, I've done a lot of testing of the Windows HDR output feature on Windows. On one of my computers that used to work flawlessly with HDR output using 4.7 dev 1 onward, a new issue has started to happen: it appears that the `DXGI_OUTPUT_DESC1` is always returning `DXGI_COLOR_SPACE_RGB_FULL_G22_NONE_P709` when the screen is in HDR mode:\n\n<img width=\"2572\" height=\"1169\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a33eb8a8-4dca-4764-b864-9dab7328a4e3\" />\n\nUsing `master` with the new game view changes, the game view confirms as well that the game is running in SDR mode:\n\n<img width=\"2567\" height=\"1267\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63afa262-8a8e-4e97-b440-5e7fd9d32add\" />\n\nI do not know what has changed with my system configuration to cause this issue to start happening. It only seems to happen when I start my game when Windows is in SDR mode  and I then switch to HDR mode.\n\nIf I open the windows display settings when the bug is happening, suddenly the game correctly switches to HDR mode:\n<img width=\"2305\" height=\"849\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ca58b12-799a-47b6-bb09-23203423125d\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project with HDR 2D enabled and Request HDR output enabled.\n2. Set Windows to SDR mode\n3. Run the project\n4. Switch Windows to HDR mode using the Win + Alt + B keyboard shortcut\n5. Note that Godot is not running in HDR mode, even though Windows is in HDR mode\n\nCurrently this is happening about 90% of the time when I run my game. I am running it in debug mode from the editor.\n\nThe bug also happens with the game in embedded mode or not embedded mode, but it happens more when not in embedded mode.\n<img width=\"2479\" height=\"851\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de87f43b-bf45-41b8-b063-16532819a5f6\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[hdr-output-basic-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26759341/hdr-output-basic-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118618/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118618/timeline","performed_via_git